60
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:27,115
[Host] It means case, or situation.

61
00:06:27,716 --> 00:06:43,124
[Slow] いちばん大きい「260サイズ」の荷物は、8420円から1万100円になって、1680円高くなります。

62
00:06:43,923 --> 00:06:54,939
[Host] The biggest, size two hundred sixty, goes from eight thousand four hundred twenty yen to ten thousand one hundred, up one thousand six hundred eighty.

63
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:57,843
[Vocab] 荷物

64
00:06:58,244 --> 00:07:00,836
[Host] It means a package, or luggage.

65
00:07:01,435 --> 00:07:07,939
[Slow] 大きい荷物ほど、値上げの幅が大きくなります。

66
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:12,339
[Host] The bigger the package, the bigger the price increase.

67
00:07:12,939 --> 00:07:15,148
[Vocab] 値上げ

68
00:07:15,548 --> 00:07:17,636
[Host] It means a price increase.

69
